  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Mumbai: <a href=\"/tag/hcg+cancer+hospital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">HCG Cancer Hospital</a>, Colaba and <a href=\"/tag/asian+cancer+institute\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Asian Cancer Institute</a> (ACI), Cumballa Hill have announced a strategic collaboration to strengthen access to <a href=\"/tag/cancer+care\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">cancer care</a>.According to HCG, the institutes will be leveraging clinical capabilities, infrastructure, technology and professional expertise as part of this collaboration.The partnership will focus on providing patients with comprehensive <a href=\"/tag/multidisciplinary+cancer+treatment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">multidisciplinary cancer treatment</a>, ease patient navigation and academic, training and knowledge-sharing initiatives.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>HCG added that both the institutes are working on establishing standardized clinical pathways and multidisciplinary collaboration to simplify a patient’s journey as they undergo treatment.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>Dr. Manish Mattoo, Executive Director and CEO, HealthCare Global Enterprises Limited said, “Cancer treatment today requires more than individual clinical interventions. It demands multidisciplinary expertise, advanced technology, evidence-based protocols and seamless coordination across specialties. Through this partnership, patients will benefit from a model where clinical expertise, technology and hospital infrastructure come together around the individual patient’s needs, rather than requiring the patient to navigate a complex healthcare system independently.”</p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Sep 16, 2026 at 08:41 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Sep 16, 2026 at 08:41 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHealthworld App</a> and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                                            <!-- <div class=\"app-store-container desktop-view\">\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"\" aria-label=\"Play Store\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-g-play.png\" alt=\"\" />\n                            </a>\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"App Store\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-app-store.png\" alt=\"\" />\n                            </a>\n                        </div>    -->\n                         \n                \n                                    <figure>\n                        <!-- <i></i>\n                        <span class=\"scan-text\">Scan to download App</span> -->\n                        <img src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/bar-codes/health_barcode.png?mod=3462\" alt=\"\">                        \n                        <!-- <span class=\"border-bottom\">